  "definition": "Renewal of License",
  "effectiveDate": "2019-10-24",
  "historyNote": "#7866, eff 4-2-03; ss by #9895, eff 4-2-11, EXPIRED: 4-2-19 New. #12767, INTERIM, eff 5-2-19, EXPIRES: 10-29-19; ss by #12911, eff 10-24-19 (formerly He-C 6448.18)",
